@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #43546B
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam componentStyle uml2
title System context — proposed text-first CRM
left to right direction
actor "Analyst\nAssigned customers" as Analyst
actor "Manager\nOrganisation-wide review" as Manager
actor "Administrator" as Admin
rectangle "Intelligent CRM Platform\nCustomer records, text interactions,\nanalysis and human review" as CRM
rectangle "Text source\nManual entry or JSON file" as Source
cloud "Optional external inference provider\nDisabled until data-use decision" as Provider
Analyst --> CRM : capture, analyse, review
Manager --> CRM : inspect, review, export
Admin --> CRM : manage accounts and access
Source --> CRM : validated text import
CRM ..> Provider : optional approved analysis
note bottom of CRM
Single organisation, English-first evaluation.
No direct customer messaging or live call recording.
end note
@enduml
